{
  "mn17:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 17 ",
  "mn17:0.2": "Vanapatthasutta ",
  "mn17:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn17:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn17:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn17:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn17:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn17:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn17:2.1": "“vanapatthapariyāyaṁ vo, bhikkhave, desessāmi, ",
  "mn17:2.2": "taṁ suṇātha, sādhukaṁ manasikarotha, bhāsissāmī”ti. ",
  "mn17:2.3": "“Evaṁ, bhante”ti kho te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn17:2.4": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn17:3.1": "“Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu aññataraṁ vanapatthaṁ upanissāya viharati. ",
  "mn17:3.2": "Tassa taṁ vanapatthaṁ upanissāya viharato anupaṭṭhitā ceva sati na upaṭṭhāti, asamāhitañca cittaṁ na samādhiyati, aparikkhīṇā ca āsavā na parikkhayaṁ gacchanti, ananuppattañca anuttaraṁ yogakkhemaṁ nānupāpuṇāti. ",
  "mn17:3.3": "Ye ca kho ime pabbajitena jīvitaparikkhārā samudānetabbā—cīvarapiṇḍapātasenāsanagilānappaccayabhesajjaparikkhārā—te kasirena samudāgacchanti. ",
  "mn17:3.4": "Tena, bhikkhave, bhikkhunā iti paṭisañcikkhitabbaṁ: ",
  "mn17:3.5": "‘ahaṁ kho imaṁ vanapatthaṁ upanissāya viharāmi, tassa me imaṁ vanapatthaṁ upanissāya viharato anupaṭṭhitā ceva sati na upaṭṭhāti, asamāhitañca cittaṁ na samādhiyati, aparikk